cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use kiri, please cite it as below."
title: "kiri: a single-binary Google Cloud emulator"
abstract: >-
  kiri emulates 108 Google Cloud services locally from one Go binary, drop-in for
  the Google Cloud SDKs, gcloud, and Terraform, with a Cost Explorer style surface
  for offline architecture pricing.
